::cue(c.green) { color: green; }
::cue(c.yellow) { color: yellow; }
##

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.070 line:91%
I have no idea what's
about to happen at all,

00:00:04.070 --> 00:00:05.570 line:91%
but we just walked
through the public bits

00:00:05.570 --> 00:00:08.030 line:91%
of Peak Cavern,
where the tourists go.

00:00:08.030 --> 00:00:09.587 line:85%
This is Elise Freshwater-Blizzard.

00:00:09.587 --> 00:00:10.420 line:85%
<c.cyan>Hi!</c>

00:00:10.420 --> 00:00:11.600 line:85%
Introduce yourself, by all means.

00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:13.914 line:91%
<c.cyan>Hi everyone on
Tom Scott's new channel.</c>

00:00:13.914 --> 00:00:14.960 line:85%
<i>(laughs)</i>

00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:16.670 line:91%
<c.cyan>It's really nice
to meet you, I'm Elise,</c>

00:00:16.670 --> 00:00:19.170 line:85%
<c.cyan>and today I'm taking Tom caving,</c>

00:00:19.170 --> 00:00:20.003 line:85%
<c.cyan>and like he says,</c>

00:00:20.003 --> 00:00:22.193 position:59% line:85%
<c.cyan>he has no idea what's going to happen.</c>

00:00:23.320 --> 00:00:26.547 line:91%
You know, the safety crew know,
the camera crew know.

00:00:26.547 --> 00:00:29.780 line:91%
I have no idea what I'm
getting myself into.

00:00:29.780 --> 00:00:31.210 line:85%
I mean, yeah, that's a slide.

00:00:31.210 --> 00:00:32.340 line:85%
<c.cyan>- Oh, yeah.</c>

00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:33.173 line:85%
I think I might be more terrified

00:00:33.173 --> 00:00:35.490 position:58% line:85%
of the idea of claustrophobic spaces.

00:00:35.490 --> 00:00:38.231 line:85%
Genuinely, just a slide to nowhere.

00:00:38.231 --> 00:00:41.398 line:85%
<c.colorCCCCCC><i>(both laugh)</i></c>

00:00:42.270 --> 00:00:43.650 position:64% line:85%
All right, what have I let myself in for?

00:00:43.650 --> 00:00:44.499 line:85%
Here we go.

00:00:44.499 --> 00:00:47.166 size:72% position:64% line:85%
<c.colorCCCCCC><i>(slide swishes)</i></c>

00:00:55.510 --> 00:00:56.343 line:85%
Okay, so,

00:00:58.070 --> 00:00:59.090 line:85%
I was briefly worried.

00:00:59.090 --> 00:01:00.880 line:91%
I don't know why I was
worried about getting muddy,

00:01:00.880 --> 00:01:01.887 line:91%
given what we're about to do,
but I have,

00:01:01.887 --> 00:01:03.402 line:85%
I have no worries about that now.

00:01:03.402 --> 00:01:04.413 line:85%
That's fine.

00:01:04.413 --> 00:01:05.856 position:61% line:85%
<c.cyan>Yeah, that's been ticked off your list,</c>

00:01:05.856 --> 00:01:07.301 line:91%
<c.cyan>and it's only going to
get muddier, Tom, so.</c>

00:01:07.301 --> 00:01:08.567 line:85%
Ah, good, wonderful, wonderful(!)

00:01:08.567 --> 00:01:10.743 line:91%
<c.cyan>Let's go.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Lead the way, lead the way.</c>

00:01:10.743 --> 00:01:12.130 line:85%
I wish I could sound enthusiastic,

00:01:12.130 --> 00:01:14.416 line:85%
I'm just genuinely nervous.

00:01:14.416 --> 00:01:16.070 line:85%
Okay, this is fine.

00:01:16.070 --> 00:01:18.237 line:85%
This is a big open cavern.

00:01:19.298 --> 00:01:21.810 line:85%
<c.cyan>Yeah, and if it ever does flood,</c>

00:01:21.810 --> 00:01:23.230 line:85%
<c.cyan>we'd know straight away</c>

00:01:23.230 --> 00:01:25.280 line:91%
<c.cyan>cause we'd stop being
able to hear the river</c>

00:01:25.280 --> 00:01:27.328 line:85%
<c.cyan>that flows below us just there.</c>

00:01:27.328 --> 00:01:28.161 line:85%
Right.

00:01:28.161 --> 00:01:29.270 line:85%
<c.cyan>But it's not going to flood today.</c>

00:01:29.270 --> 00:01:32.494 line:91%
<c.cyan>It's a brilliant nice, dry day,
so don't worry about that one, Tom.</c>

00:01:32.494 --> 00:01:33.411 line:85%
Oh, good(!)

00:01:38.148 --> 00:01:41.314 line:85%
<c.colorCCCCCC><i>(water splashes)</i></c>

00:01:41.314 --> 00:01:44.560 line:91%
So this floods all the way up
above our heads filling the tunnel?

00:01:44.560 --> 00:01:46.430 line:85%
<c.cyan>Oh, absolutely, yeah.</c>

00:01:46.430 --> 00:01:48.920 line:91%
<c.cyan>We have a lot of indicators
before it does flood,</c>

00:01:48.920 --> 00:01:51.470 line:85%
<c.cyan>but it'll flood the whole system</c>

00:01:51.470 --> 00:01:53.000 line:85%
<c.cyan>in this room when it does.</c>

00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:53.833 line:85%
Wow.

00:01:53.833 --> 00:01:56.200 position:63% line:85%
<c.cyan>So, all the way up to the ceiling there,</c>

00:01:56.200 --> 00:01:58.420 position:63% line:85%
<c.cyan>and we measure it pretty much each time,</c>

00:01:58.420 --> 00:02:00.410 position:59% line:85%
<c.cyan>just out of curiosity, we want to know</c>

00:02:01.610 --> 00:02:05.159 line:91%
<c.cyan>just how much it takes
rain to get it to flood.</c>

00:02:05.159 --> 00:02:06.666 line:85%
Yeah.

00:02:06.666 --> 00:02:08.166 line:85%
<c.cyan>All right, guys.</c>

00:02:09.270 --> 00:02:11.480 line:85%
Okay, into the water.

00:02:11.480 --> 00:02:13.340 line:85%
<c.cyan>If it's any consolation...</c>

00:02:13.340 --> 00:02:14.173 line:85%
Yeah?

00:02:14.173 --> 00:02:15.094 line:85%
<c.cyan>This is really low.</c>

00:02:15.094 --> 00:02:16.030 line:85%
Okay.

00:02:16.030 --> 00:02:17.840 line:91%
<c.cyan>So we've actually
come on a very good day.</c>

00:02:17.840 --> 00:02:19.787 line:85%
Cool, all right.

00:02:19.787 --> 00:02:22.446 line:85%
<c.colorCCCCCC><i>(both laugh)</i></c>

00:02:22.446 --> 00:02:25.196 line:85%
<c.colorCCCCCC><i>(water splashes)</i></c>

00:02:26.180 --> 00:02:28.082 line:85%
Okay, so the best way is back?

00:02:28.082 --> 00:02:29.626 line:91%
<c.cyan>I like to place my
back against the wall,</c>

00:02:29.626 --> 00:02:30.556 line:85%
<c.cyan>but it is up to you.</c>

00:02:30.556 --> 00:02:34.585 line:91%
Yeah, that makes sense,
okay, cool, yeah.

00:02:34.585 --> 00:02:35.418 line:85%
Okay.

00:02:35.418 --> 00:02:36.484 line:91%
<c.cyan>I've got my arm out,
if you need me.</c>

00:02:36.484 --> 00:02:38.650 line:85%
I'm good, I'm good, thank you.

00:02:38.650 --> 00:02:40.523 line:85%
Glad I've got the helmet on.

00:02:40.523 --> 00:02:43.273 line:85%
<c.colorCCCCCC><i>(water splashes)</i></c>

00:02:44.905 --> 00:02:46.024 line:85%
<c.cyan>Mine's filling up now.</c>

00:02:46.024 --> 00:02:48.954 line:85%
I'm on the borderline.

00:02:48.954 --> 00:02:49.900 line:85%
<c.cyan>Oh.</c>

00:02:49.900 --> 00:02:51.356 line:85%
I'm close, I'm not quite there.

00:02:51.356 --> 00:02:52.671 line:85%
<c.cyan>Oh, you can't see mine, but mine.</c>

00:02:52.671 --> 00:02:54.994 position:56% line:85%
Ah, yeah, okay, go for it, yeah, go.

00:02:54.994 --> 00:02:55.900 line:85%
<c.cyan>Excellent.</c>

00:02:55.900 --> 00:02:57.093 line:85%
All right.

00:02:57.093 --> 00:02:59.863 line:91%
<c.cyan>My wellies are filling up
at this point!</c>

00:02:59.863 --> 00:03:03.210 position:63% line:85%
Okay, ah, okay, ah, yeah, no, that's....

00:03:03.210 --> 00:03:07.434 position:58% line:91%
Yeah, I thought I got through without
having cold water in my wellies.

00:03:07.434 --> 00:03:10.450 position:61% line:85%
Oh, no, that's wet socks, okay, lovely.

00:03:10.450 --> 00:03:11.980 line:85%
Ah, that's cold.

00:03:11.980 --> 00:03:13.400 line:85%
Ah, and that's muddy as well.

00:03:13.400 --> 00:03:14.817 line:85%
Ah, ah, ah, okay.

00:03:17.214 --> 00:03:19.069 line:85%
Ah, that's incredibly unpleasant.

00:03:19.069 --> 00:03:19.930 line:85%
Oh, that's cold!

00:03:19.930 --> 00:03:20.763 line:85%
Okay, cool.

00:03:21.625 --> 00:03:23.620 line:85%
Oh, how do you do that?

00:03:23.620 --> 00:03:24.710 line:85%
<c.cyan>We're going to do it again.</c>

00:03:24.710 --> 00:03:25.661 line:85%
Oh, good(!)

00:03:25.661 --> 00:03:26.494 line:85%
<c.cyan>(laughs)</c>

00:03:26.494 --> 00:03:27.327 line:85%
Wonderful, magical(!)

00:03:27.327 --> 00:03:28.250 line:85%
<c.cyan>Great. Are you ready?</c>

00:03:28.250 --> 00:03:29.083 line:85%
Yeah.

00:03:29.083 --> 00:03:30.030 line:85%
<c.cyan>Let's go.</c>

00:03:30.030 --> 00:03:31.577 line:85%
I hate this.

00:03:31.577 --> 00:03:34.850 line:91%
<c.cyan>All right guys, this might
be a really good bit, too.</c>

00:03:34.850 --> 00:03:36.986 line:91%
<c.cyan>It's really—</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>I... genuinely, sorry.</c>

00:03:36.986 --> 00:03:38.238 line:91%
I've got to tip some water
out of my boots.

00:03:38.238 --> 00:03:40.195 line:91%
<c.cyan>That's all right.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>That's actually too cold.</c>

00:03:40.195 --> 00:03:41.028 line:85%
Woo.

00:03:41.028 --> 00:03:42.340 line:91%
SAFETY TEAM: <c.yellow>Yeah, it's unpleasant
to begin with.</c>

00:03:42.340 --> 00:03:44.464 line:91%
Yeah, sorry. I need to take
a second, just sit down.

00:03:44.464 --> 00:03:47.270 line:91%
'Cause that's actually
almost painfully cold.

00:03:47.270 --> 00:03:48.747 line:85%
Bloody hell!

00:03:48.747 --> 00:03:50.330 line:85%
Aw!

00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:52.426 line:91%
How do you do that?
That is freezing cold,

00:03:52.426 --> 00:03:55.001 line:85%
and it's stuck at my feet.

00:03:55.001 --> 00:03:55.834 line:85%
Whew.

00:03:59.979 --> 00:04:01.323 line:85%
<i>(wheezes)</i>

00:04:01.323 --> 00:04:02.156 line:85%
- Are you all right there, Tom?

00:04:02.156 --> 00:04:02.989 line:91%
- I mean I'm laughing,
but yeah, that's...

00:04:02.989 --> 00:04:06.330 line:91%
that's actually painfully
cold. That hurts.

00:04:06.330 --> 00:04:07.816 line:91%
<c.cyan>Just take a breath.</c>
<c.yellow>Five minutes.</c>

00:04:07.816 --> 00:04:12.077 line:91%
<c.yellow>Your heat, body temperature
will warm the boots.</c>

00:04:12.077 --> 00:04:14.980 line:91%
<c.cyan>So after five minutes,
the water inside your boots</c>

00:04:14.980 --> 00:04:17.048 line:91%
<c.cyan>is going to become your
own body temperature,</c>

00:04:17.048 --> 00:04:19.280 line:85%
<c.cyan>and that's how we get used to it.</c>

00:04:19.280 --> 00:04:21.810 line:91%
<c.cyan>So the first bit is
really difficult for sure.</c>

00:04:21.810 --> 00:04:23.250 line:85%
Yeah.

00:04:23.250 --> 00:04:25.353 line:85%
Oh, bloody hell!

00:04:29.318 --> 00:04:32.260 line:91%
That is like someone's
taken a pitcher of ice water,

00:04:32.260 --> 00:04:34.320 line:91%
which, literally like,
it is that cold,

00:04:34.320 --> 00:04:36.930 line:85%
and poured it down both my shoes.

00:04:36.930 --> 00:04:38.390 line:85%
How is it...

00:04:38.390 --> 00:04:39.420 line:85%
How are you okay with that?

00:04:39.420 --> 00:04:41.890 line:85%
Also like camera team, safety team,

00:04:41.890 --> 00:04:45.800 line:91%
how am I the only one
grumbling about that?

00:04:45.800 --> 00:04:46.633 line:85%
Whew.

00:04:49.732 --> 00:04:50.899 line:85%
Give me a sec.

00:04:54.490 --> 00:04:55.713 line:85%
Well, that's actually...

00:04:58.960 --> 00:05:01.350 position:56% line:85%
like, literally I can hear the water

00:05:01.350 --> 00:05:05.240 position:64% line:85%
coming out of the camera op's boots here,

00:05:05.240 --> 00:05:08.370 line:85%
and he's fine.

00:05:08.370 --> 00:05:09.580 line:85%
And you're fine.

00:05:09.580 --> 00:05:13.170 line:85%
I'm genuinely not.

00:05:13.170 --> 00:05:15.511 line:91%
How am I getting cold
water shock off that?

00:05:15.511 --> 00:05:18.180 line:91%
That's genuinely... I need
to properly sit down.

00:05:18.180 --> 00:05:19.330 line:85%
Yeah. Give me a minute.

00:05:22.265 --> 00:05:24.392 line:85%
That got real very quickly.

00:05:24.392 --> 00:05:25.731 line:85%
<i>(chuckles)</i>

00:05:25.731 --> 00:05:27.380 line:85%
<c.green>Yeah, legs up.</c>

00:05:27.380 --> 00:05:28.860 line:91%
<c.green>If you can, Tom,</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Yeah.</c>

00:05:28.860 --> 00:05:30.070 line:85%
<c.green>find a point</c>

00:05:30.070 --> 00:05:31.050 line:91%
<c.green>where you can prop your
legs up a little bit,</c>

00:05:31.050 --> 00:05:33.030 line:91%
<c.green>just so you can
keep your head a bit lower</c>

00:05:33.030 --> 00:05:34.430 line:85%
<c.green>in proportion to your knees,</c>

00:05:34.430 --> 00:05:36.580 line:91%
<c.green>and that will stop you
beginning to feel shock.</c>

00:05:36.580 --> 00:05:37.413 line:85%
Yeah.

00:05:41.500 --> 00:05:42.333 line:85%
Yeah.

00:05:43.940 --> 00:05:46.659 line:91%
<c.green>If you just, like, lean
against me a little bit more.</c>

00:05:46.659 --> 00:05:47.552 line:85%
Yep.

00:05:47.552 --> 00:05:49.145 line:85%
<c.yellow>Or twizzle around. Yeah.</c>

00:05:49.145 --> 00:05:50.489 line:91%
Okay now, hang on, hang on,
hang on, hang on, hang on.

00:05:50.489 --> 00:05:52.155 line:91%
<c.green>If you're able to.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Yeah.</c>

00:05:52.155 --> 00:05:53.560 line:91%
I want to keep the water
in my boots, though,

00:05:53.560 --> 00:05:55.580 line:91%
cause otherwise I'm going to
have this again in five minutes.

00:05:55.580 --> 00:05:56.862 line:85%
<c.green>Without wanting to do that.</c>

00:05:56.862 --> 00:05:57.695 line:85%
Yeah.

00:05:57.695 --> 00:05:59.352 line:91%
<c.green>If you're comfortable,
just leaning backwards.</c>

00:05:59.352 --> 00:06:00.911 line:85%
Yeah. Okay.

00:06:00.911 --> 00:06:03.405 line:85%
<c.green>I'm fine being a prop.</c>

00:06:03.405 --> 00:06:04.580 line:85%
<i>(laughs)</i>

00:06:04.580 --> 00:06:06.639 line:85%
That's genuinely embarrassing.

00:06:06.639 --> 00:06:08.855 line:85%
I don't know what to do about this.

00:06:08.855 --> 00:06:10.670 line:91%
I mean, I knew we were going
outside my comfort zone,

00:06:10.670 --> 00:06:11.690 position:58% line:85%
but I did not realise my comfort zone

00:06:11.690 --> 00:06:15.690 line:91%
was like... having cold feet.
That's, that's embarrassing.

00:06:15.690 --> 00:06:18.150 line:91%
So this is not what I
expected. Thank you, Elise.

00:06:18.150 --> 00:06:19.870 line:85%
I was expecting this to happen

00:06:19.870 --> 00:06:22.827 line:91%
like a long way in, and
we'd have mild problems,

00:06:22.827 --> 00:06:25.030 line:91%
and it turns out what I've
actually had is just like...

00:06:25.030 --> 00:06:26.100 line:85%
what I assume is like, thermal...

00:06:26.100 --> 00:06:27.350 line:85%
I'm talking to my safety guy, now.

00:06:27.350 --> 00:06:29.030 line:91%
Like thermal shock response,
something like that?

00:06:29.030 --> 00:06:29.863 line:85%
<c.yellow>Yeah, yeah, yeah.</c>

00:06:29.863 --> 00:06:31.510 position:63% line:85%
<c.yellow>It affects different people differently.</c>

00:06:31.510 --> 00:06:32.343 line:85%
Yeah.

00:06:32.343 --> 00:06:34.079 line:91%
<c.yellow>You may find that
now you've had it,</c>

00:06:34.079 --> 00:06:34.980 line:85%
<c.yellow>Yeah.</c>

00:06:34.980 --> 00:06:37.220 line:85%
<c.yellow>the rest of it doesn't bother you.</c>

00:06:37.220 --> 00:06:38.940 size:81% position:59% line:91%
<c.yellow>But yeah, you're certainly
not the first person</c>

00:06:38.940 --> 00:06:41.197 line:91%
<c.yellow>who's found that
really unpleasantly cold.</c>

00:06:41.197 --> 00:06:43.010 line:91%
<c.yellow>So don't worry about it.
- Yeah.</c>

00:06:43.010 --> 00:06:44.057 line:85%
Like, I can, don't get me wrong,

00:06:44.057 --> 00:06:46.400 line:85%
I can deal with cold feet,

00:06:46.400 --> 00:06:51.000 line:91%
but what happened though
was just sudden body nausea

00:06:51.000 --> 00:06:53.850 line:91%
and almost like my brain
starting to shut down.

00:06:53.850 --> 00:06:56.103 line:85%
It was like, stop this now,

00:06:57.090 --> 00:07:01.470 line:85%
and I am genuinely worried that

00:07:01.470 --> 00:07:04.270 line:91%
that's my body's response
to cold water on my feet?

00:07:06.046 --> 00:07:06.910 line:85%
<i>(laughs weakly)</i>

00:07:06.910 --> 00:07:08.834 position:56% line:85%
<c.cyan>It's a very normal response, indeed.</c>

00:07:08.834 --> 00:07:09.880 line:85%
Yeah.

00:07:09.880 --> 00:07:10.900 line:85%
<c.cyan>A lot of people come in with that.</c>

00:07:10.900 --> 00:07:14.850 line:91%
<c.yellow>Sometimes it's physiologically
location specific, as well.</c>

00:07:14.850 --> 00:07:17.383 line:91%
<c.yellow>Because you're slightly out of your
comfort zone, underground.</c>

00:07:17.383 --> 00:07:19.674 line:85%
Okay, I think I'm good to go now.

00:07:19.674 --> 00:07:21.063 line:85%
What, what happened?

00:07:21.063 --> 00:07:23.030 line:85%
Because I basically just—

00:07:23.030 --> 00:07:24.860 line:91%
<c.cyan>You've just had
cold water shock, Tom.</c>

00:07:24.860 --> 00:07:25.693 line:85%
Right.

00:07:25.693 --> 00:07:26.526 line:85%
<c.cyan>And you'll be absolutely fine.</c>

00:07:26.526 --> 00:07:29.885 line:91%
<c.cyan>You just needed five minutes
just to reconfigure</c>

00:07:29.885 --> 00:07:31.812 line:91%
<c.cyan>your body there, but
you are absolutely fine.</c>

00:07:31.812 --> 00:07:32.645 line:85%
Okay.

00:07:32.645 --> 00:07:33.478 line:85%
<c.colorCCCCCC><i>(Tom and Elise laugh)</i></c>

00:07:33.478 --> 00:07:34.763 line:85%
That's genuinely...

00:07:36.090 --> 00:07:37.667 line:91%
Like, I knew this was going to
be outside my comfort zone,

00:07:37.667 --> 00:07:42.667 line:91%
but I did not expect just cold
freezing water on my feet,

00:07:43.090 --> 00:07:44.220 line:85%
for some reason...

00:07:44.220 --> 00:07:45.540 line:85%
<c.cyan>Even if it's summer, right?</c>

00:07:45.540 --> 00:07:46.700 line:91%
Yeah.
<c.cyan>Yeah.</c>

00:07:46.700 --> 00:07:51.250 line:91%
Something about that caused
my body to go into just... panic.

00:07:51.250 --> 00:07:54.380 line:91%
Mind was fine. I've been
talking through it, but body...

00:07:54.380 --> 00:07:56.680 line:91%
All right, well let's
keep going. That's fine(!)

00:07:57.757 --> 00:07:58.590 line:85%
Lead the way.

00:07:58.590 --> 00:08:01.494 line:85%
<c.cyan>He's all right!</c>

00:08:01.494 --> 00:08:02.470 line:85%
<c.cyan>I kind of side step,</c>

00:08:02.470 --> 00:08:04.913 line:91%
<c.cyan>but you can do it
whatever way you wish.</c>

00:08:05.937 --> 00:08:07.064 position:56% line:85%
Just kind of duck walk through here.

00:08:07.064 --> 00:08:09.380 line:85%
<c.cyan>Yeah.</c>

00:08:09.380 --> 00:08:11.820 line:91%
<c.cyan>Normally the water level is
up to my waist, at this point.</c>

00:08:11.820 --> 00:08:16.413 position:63% line:91%
Okay, I'm really, really glad we came in
on a dry day, cause this is...

00:08:19.077 --> 00:08:19.910 line:85%
Okay.

00:08:23.262 --> 00:08:24.799 line:85%
Oh, there's the rock. Yep, okay.

00:08:24.799 --> 00:08:25.632 line:85%
<c.cyan>Found the rock.</c>

00:08:25.632 --> 00:08:30.049 line:91%
That's the one everyone
trips over. I got it.

00:08:31.187 --> 00:08:32.770 line:85%
Why do you do this?!

00:08:40.400 --> 00:08:42.733 line:85%
That's my hand wet as well.

00:08:43.932 --> 00:08:44.765 line:85%
Okay.

00:08:46.009 --> 00:08:47.762 line:91%
<c.cyan>All right, you've committed.
You're in the cave now.</c>

00:08:47.762 --> 00:08:50.582 line:85%
Yeah. <i>(laughs)</i>

00:08:50.582 --> 00:08:51.415 line:85%
<c.cyan>You want to take a seat?</c>

00:08:51.415 --> 00:08:53.165 line:85%
Yep, hang on.

00:08:54.146 --> 00:08:55.563 line:85%
Oh, yeah. Oh, no.

00:08:56.410 --> 00:08:58.410 line:91%
How? Oh, my God,
it's the same reaction.

00:09:02.660 --> 00:09:03.493 line:85%
I—

00:09:21.220 --> 00:09:22.412 line:85%
<c.yellow>That's it. Just catch your breath.</c>

00:09:22.412 --> 00:09:24.245 line:91%
Yeah.
<c.cyan>Yeah.</c>

00:09:31.270 --> 00:09:34.270 line:91%
It's really weird doing this while
there's three cameras on me.

00:09:34.270 --> 00:09:35.440 line:85%
<c.yellow><i>(laughs)</i></c>

00:09:35.440 --> 00:09:37.051 line:85%
It's...

00:09:37.051 --> 00:09:38.995 line:85%
no, I'm fine.

00:09:38.995 --> 00:09:43.157 line:91%
Like, I know I'm fine, but
my body's telling me I'm not.

00:09:47.500 --> 00:09:50.550 line:91%
<c.cyan>To be fair, that's a really
natural reaction to have.</c>

00:09:50.550 --> 00:09:51.383 line:85%
Yeah.

00:09:51.383 --> 00:09:54.670 line:91%
<c.cyan>You just sit through it,
and just, yeah, relax, lie down.</c>

00:09:54.670 --> 00:09:57.765 line:85%
It's really, it's embarrassing.

00:09:57.765 --> 00:09:58.598 line:85%
<c.cyan>It's not!</c>

00:09:58.598 --> 00:10:01.890 position:59% line:91%
Cause there's six people in this cave,
and only one of them

00:10:01.890 --> 00:10:04.240 line:91%
is physically unable to
walk through cold water,

00:10:04.240 --> 00:10:06.090 line:85%
and has only just found this out!

00:10:14.070 --> 00:10:16.580 line:85%
I think I was fine with all this.

00:10:16.580 --> 00:10:18.150 line:85%
That bit, it's something like...

00:10:18.150 --> 00:10:20.190 position:56% line:85%
I'm glad the water's not any higher.

00:10:20.190 --> 00:10:21.023 line:85%
<c.cyan>Yeah.</c>

00:10:21.023 --> 00:10:24.110 position:58% line:91%
Because I think if that hit my chest,
I'd have been in trouble.

00:10:33.900 --> 00:10:35.120 line:85%
Okay.

00:10:35.120 --> 00:10:36.570 line:85%
That's....

00:10:36.570 --> 00:10:37.403 line:85%
Okay, so the good news is

00:10:37.403 --> 00:10:38.580 position:59% line:85%
I've found something out about myself!

00:10:38.580 --> 00:10:39.501 line:85%
Thank you for that.

00:10:39.501 --> 00:10:41.218 line:85%
<c.colorCCCCCC><i>(everyone laughs)</i></c>

00:10:41.218 --> 00:10:44.440 line:85%
And thank you Pete, safety team,

00:10:44.440 --> 00:10:45.820 line:85%
for making sure I'm medically okay.

00:10:45.820 --> 00:10:49.640 line:91%
Like the good news is, I have found
something out about my body.

00:10:49.640 --> 00:10:53.360 line:91%
The bad news is, ah,
I can't do cold water.

00:10:53.360 --> 00:10:54.193 line:85%
<c.cyan>Okay.</c>

00:10:54.193 --> 00:10:55.743 line:91%
That's all right.
That is... that is news.

00:10:55.743 --> 00:11:00.180 line:91%
That is not something I
knew until five minutes ago.

00:11:00.180 --> 00:11:01.670 line:85%
How deep's the next bit?

00:11:01.670 --> 00:11:03.302 line:85%
<c.cyan>How deep, do you think?</c>

00:11:03.302 --> 00:11:04.968 line:91%
<c.yellow>It's thigh deep.</c>
<c.cyan>Depends on the water level.</c>

00:11:04.968 --> 00:11:07.250 position:66% line:85%
<c.yellow>I won't... I'm not going to sugar coat it.</c>

00:11:07.250 --> 00:11:10.260 line:91%
<c.yellow>As you stand in the water,
the water level's about there.</c>

00:11:10.260 --> 00:11:12.210 line:91%
<c.yellow>The roof, however, is
about that much above it,</c>

00:11:12.210 --> 00:11:13.480 line:85%
<c.yellow>so you'll go through like this...</c>

00:11:13.480 --> 00:11:14.730 line:85%
I can't physically do that.

00:11:14.730 --> 00:11:17.456 line:85%
<c.yellow>So I was wondering how you might...</c>

00:11:17.456 --> 00:11:18.289 line:85%
<c.cyan>Yeah.</c>

00:11:18.289 --> 00:11:20.173 line:85%
No, like, I can't.

00:11:21.410 --> 00:11:23.700 line:85%
Oh, I hate saying these words.

00:11:23.700 --> 00:11:26.283 line:85%
I can't physically do that.

00:11:26.283 --> 00:11:29.650 line:91%
<c.yellow>- That's... it's not a problem.
So to...</c>

00:11:29.650 --> 00:11:33.350 line:91%
<c.yellow>all you need to do water-wise
from this point in the trip</c>

00:11:33.350 --> 00:11:34.710 line:85%
<c.yellow>is what you've done already.</c>

00:11:34.710 --> 00:11:35.628 line:85%
Yeah.

00:11:35.628 --> 00:11:36.461 line:85%
<c.yellow>Once we get to the deeper stuff,</c>

00:11:36.461 --> 00:11:37.294 line:91%
<c.yellow>obviously you don't
have to go any further.</c>

00:11:37.294 --> 00:11:38.630 line:85%
Yeah.

00:11:38.630 --> 00:11:39.980 line:85%
<c.yellow>When we get to the next wet bit,</c>

00:11:39.980 --> 00:11:42.773 position:64% line:91%
<c.yellow>I'm quite happy to kind of slide in first
and show you how I do it,</c>

00:11:42.773 --> 00:11:44.420 position:59% line:85%
<c.yellow>and then you might make your own mind,</c>

00:11:44.420 --> 00:11:47.470 line:91%
<c.yellow>but I understand that you
probably won't, and that's fine.</c>

00:11:47.470 --> 00:11:49.905 line:91%
It's more that I don't
want to take the risk.

00:11:49.905 --> 00:11:50.738 line:85%
<c.yellow>Yeah, yeah, yeah.</c>

00:11:50.738 --> 00:11:54.360 line:91%
Like that's... and that's
a horrible thing to—

00:11:54.360 --> 00:11:57.973 position:58% line:91%
Everything I'm saying now is
against everything that I believe in.

00:11:57.973 --> 00:12:02.250 line:91%
Like I really, really want to
push myself and get in that.

00:12:02.250 --> 00:12:03.083 line:85%
<c.yellow>Yeah, yeah.</c>

00:12:03.083 --> 00:12:05.801 line:91%
The athletes who go into
ice baths or stuff like that,

00:12:05.801 --> 00:12:08.237 position:58% line:85%
I could have built that tolerance up?

00:12:08.237 --> 00:12:09.070 line:85%
<c.yellow>Yeah.</c>

00:12:09.070 --> 00:12:12.253 line:91%
But having not done anything
like that since I was a kid...

00:12:14.130 --> 00:12:16.393 line:85%
Oh, this sucks!

00:12:16.393 --> 00:12:19.340 line:85%
I am so angry with myself!

00:12:19.340 --> 00:12:22.370 line:91%
I am going to be grumpy
about this for long while.

00:12:22.370 --> 00:12:26.946 position:58% line:91%
<c.cyan>But, however, having said that,
cavers really like a person like you,</c>

00:12:26.946 --> 00:12:28.360 line:91%
<i>(laughs)
</i><c.cyan>because we would rather</c>

00:12:28.360 --> 00:12:31.500 line:91%
<c.colorCCCCCC><i><b>you say what you're saying
now, than not tell anyone,</b></i></c>

00:12:31.500 --> 00:12:34.990 position:63% line:91%
<c.colorCCCCCC><i><b>go through it, and then we have
something really difficult to deal with.</b></i></c>

00:12:34.990 --> 00:12:37.180 line:91%
Plus, you looked badass,
and I did not!

00:12:37.180 --> 00:12:40.180 line:85%
So let's go as deep as we can.

00:12:40.180 --> 00:12:41.970 line:85%
Let's get as far as we can here,

00:12:41.970 --> 00:12:43.700 line:85%
show me what you can,

00:12:43.700 --> 00:12:46.803 position:64% line:91%
and then I'll steel myself for going back
through the other way.

00:12:46.803 --> 00:12:48.137 line:91%
<c.cyan>Okay.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>All right.</c>

00:12:48.137 --> 00:12:49.304 line:85%
Just climb.

00:12:53.272 --> 00:12:55.588 position:59% line:85%
I swear, this is longer on the way up.

00:12:55.588 --> 00:12:57.059 position:59% line:85%
<c.cyan>That gap is just fit for me, isn't it?</c>

00:12:57.059 --> 00:12:57.892 line:85%
<i>(laughs)</i>

00:12:57.892 --> 00:12:58.725 line:85%
<c.cyan>I can just fit in there.</c>

00:12:58.725 --> 00:13:00.703 line:85%
Careful. Three points of contact.

00:13:06.190 --> 00:13:07.023 line:85%
Okay.

00:13:13.294 --> 00:13:16.590 line:85%
I feel almost too clean for this.

00:13:16.590 --> 00:13:20.550 line:91%
Like from the waist up, there's
not much going on there.

00:13:20.550 --> 00:13:21.383 line:85%
Waist down...

00:13:24.387 --> 00:13:25.252 line:85%
<c.cyan>Oh, yes.</c>

00:13:25.252 --> 00:13:27.669 line:85%
<i>(laughs)</i>

00:13:29.638 --> 00:13:31.108 line:91%
<c.cyan>Oh, what? You haven't even got
anything on you.</c>

00:13:31.108 --> 00:13:31.941 line:85%
I don't know how.

00:13:31.941 --> 00:13:32.774 line:85%
<c.cyan>What happened?</c>

00:13:32.774 --> 00:13:36.340 line:91%
I genuinely... apparently climbing
through mud, I can do!

00:13:36.340 --> 00:13:39.730 line:91%
That's fine.
Got no problems with mud.

00:13:39.730 --> 00:13:42.780 position:63% line:85%
You should take the camera team onwards.

00:13:42.780 --> 00:13:44.060 line:85%
So at least the audience,

00:13:44.060 --> 00:13:46.623 line:91%
you can get a couple shots
of what's beyond there.

00:13:48.010 --> 00:13:49.934 line:85%
I'll wait around with the crew.

00:13:49.934 --> 00:13:52.684 line:85%
<c.colorCCCCCC><i>(water splashes)</i></c>

00:14:01.730 --> 00:14:07.003 line:91%
I'm just waiting in the cave now
while they've gone up there.

00:14:07.003 --> 00:14:08.153 line:85%
I hope they're having fun.

00:14:08.153 --> 00:14:10.715 line:85%
<i>(laughs)</i>

00:14:10.715 --> 00:14:13.132 line:85%
<c.colorCCCCCC><i>(water runs)</i></c>

00:14:15.000 --> 00:14:16.040 line:85%
They went into waist-deep water.

00:14:16.040 --> 00:14:17.180 line:85%
I wish them best of luck with that,

00:14:17.180 --> 00:14:20.123 line:91%
and I'm going to... I'm
going to wait in the cave.

00:14:21.654 --> 00:14:24.487 line:85%
<c.cyan>Wish you were here, Tom!</c>

00:14:29.442 --> 00:14:30.775 line:85%
<c.cyan>Oh, that's cold.</c>

00:14:39.123 --> 00:14:40.096 line:85%
<c.cyan>So how are you feeling?</c>

00:14:40.096 --> 00:14:42.928 line:91%
I'm okay.
I'm back here.

00:14:44.870 --> 00:14:46.440 size:75% position:63% line:85%
<c.cyan>You are back here.</c>

00:14:46.440 --> 00:14:49.983 size:75% position:63% line:85%
It's really, really,

00:14:52.410 --> 00:14:55.397 line:85%
gutting that I can't do this.

00:14:55.397 --> 00:14:58.230 line:91%
And I genuinely... part of
my brain's now wondering

00:14:58.230 --> 00:14:59.960 line:85%
whether it was just a panic attack.

00:14:59.960 --> 00:15:01.910 position:61% line:85%
I've never had one of those in my life.

00:15:03.510 --> 00:15:06.246 line:91%
Or it might be that it's
some sort of thermal thing.

00:15:06.246 --> 00:15:07.697 line:85%
I genuinely don't know.

00:15:07.697 --> 00:15:08.530 line:85%
<c.cyan>Yeah, yeah.</c>

00:15:08.530 --> 00:15:09.870 line:85%
<c.colorCCCCCC><i>(laughs)</i></c>

00:15:09.870 --> 00:15:12.540 line:91%
<c.cyan>What's good is that you've done it,
so you can do it again.</c>

00:15:12.540 --> 00:15:13.373 line:85%
<c.cyan>You know for sure what's there.</c>

00:15:13.373 --> 00:15:14.688 line:85%
Oh, yeah, I know.

00:15:14.688 --> 00:15:16.090 line:91%
Like worst case, I can
come out the other end,

00:15:16.090 --> 00:15:19.470 position:61% line:85%
and I sit down for two or three minutes

00:15:19.470 --> 00:15:22.330 line:91%
until the heart rate gets back down
and I stop feeling nauseous.

00:15:22.330 --> 00:15:23.163 line:85%
<c.cyan>Yeah.</c>

00:15:23.163 --> 00:15:25.045 line:85%
Who's going first this time?

00:15:25.045 --> 00:15:27.605 line:91%
<c.cyan>Oh, well, you know what,
I think I'll go first(!)</c>

00:15:27.605 --> 00:15:29.295 line:85%
<c.colorCCCCCC><i>(both laugh)</i></c>

00:15:29.295 --> 00:15:31.273 line:91%
<c.cyan>So you feel a bit more comfortable.
How about that?</c>

00:15:31.273 --> 00:15:32.106 line:85%
All right.

00:15:32.106 --> 00:15:33.230 line:85%
<c.cyan>Are we ready?</c>

00:15:33.230 --> 00:15:34.790 position:58% line:85%
It's just here, where it's just like,

00:15:34.790 --> 00:15:37.513 position:64% line:85%
that is my whole lower body in the water.

00:15:41.810 --> 00:15:43.463 line:85%
This is okay. This is now fine.

00:15:44.474 --> 00:15:45.307 line:85%
<c.cyan>Yeah?</c>

00:15:45.307 --> 00:15:46.910 line:85%
Yeah, not a problem.

00:15:46.910 --> 00:15:49.170 line:85%
Not a problem. No problem.

00:15:49.170 --> 00:15:51.740 line:91%
I'm aware that's what I said
up until this point last time.

00:15:52.840 --> 00:15:54.410 line:85%
<c.cyan>Mind the rocks on the floor.</c>

00:15:54.410 --> 00:15:55.290 line:85%
Yes, thank you.

00:15:55.290 --> 00:15:58.030 line:85%
Yeah, if my chest goes in now,

00:15:58.030 --> 00:15:58.920 position:56% line:85%
I'm going to have a really bad time.

00:15:58.920 --> 00:16:01.723 line:91%
<c.cyan>So, slow and smooth,
and smooth is fast.</c>

00:16:02.707 --> 00:16:04.290 line:91%
<c.cyan>Last bit.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Still good.</c>

00:16:08.220 --> 00:16:12.080 line:85%
Yeah. All right.

00:16:12.080 --> 00:16:13.280 line:85%
<c.cyan>Great?</c>

00:16:13.280 --> 00:16:14.122 line:85%
Yeah.

00:16:14.122 --> 00:16:15.667 line:91%
<c.cyan>Good job, you're
committed to it now.</c>

00:16:15.667 --> 00:16:16.500 line:85%
<c.colorCCCCCC><i>(both laugh)</i></c>

00:16:16.500 --> 00:16:18.600 line:85%
All right, we're halfway there.

00:16:18.600 --> 00:16:20.123 line:85%
I mean, it's still unpleasant,

00:16:21.385 --> 00:16:23.253 line:91%
but there's still something
really going on

00:16:23.253 --> 00:16:26.043 line:91%
with my legs right now that
is not meant to be a thing.

00:16:26.043 --> 00:16:27.360 line:91%
So I need to take a second.
<c.cyan>Yes.</c>

00:16:27.360 --> 00:16:30.163 line:85%
But, breath's fine.

00:16:31.510 --> 00:16:32.759 line:85%
Stomach's fine.

00:16:32.759 --> 00:16:33.592 line:85%
<c.cyan>Yeah.</c>

00:16:33.592 --> 00:16:34.463 line:85%
Yeah, we're good.

00:16:34.463 --> 00:16:35.376 line:85%
That's just, yeah.

00:16:35.376 --> 00:16:38.077 line:85%
That's okay. We're good.

00:16:38.077 --> 00:16:39.538 line:85%
<c.cyan>Yes, excellent.</c>

00:16:39.538 --> 00:16:41.294 line:85%
And this is the easy route?

00:16:41.294 --> 00:16:44.294 line:91%
<c.cyan>Yes, this is the easy bit.
And it's shorter as well.</c>

00:16:52.441 --> 00:16:54.290 line:85%
Okay.

00:16:54.290 --> 00:16:55.123 line:85%
<c.cyan>This is it.</c>

00:16:55.123 --> 00:16:55.956 line:85%
Thank you.

00:16:57.243 --> 00:17:00.000 line:85%
So, what have I learned?

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:03.230 position:63% line:91%
I don't know if that was a body reaction
or a brain reaction.

00:17:03.230 --> 00:17:05.420 line:85%
I've got no idea, on the way in,

00:17:05.420 --> 00:17:08.120 line:91%
because I'm perfectly happy
to stand in this now.

00:17:08.120 --> 00:17:13.120 line:91%
So I cannot tell you if that
was my body freaking out

00:17:13.150 --> 00:17:15.210 line:85%
or if it was a panic attack,

00:17:15.210 --> 00:17:18.130 line:91%
which I've never had
in my life, but maybe,

00:17:18.130 --> 00:17:22.330 line:91%
maybe this is so strange
that I genuinely do not know.

00:17:22.330 --> 00:17:24.299 line:91%
<c.cyan>Wow. I just gave Tom Scott
a panic attack(!)</c>

00:17:24.299 --> 00:17:26.387 line:91%
Yeah.
<c.colorCCCCCC><i>(both laugh)</i></c>

00:17:26.387 --> 00:17:28.530 line:85%
Or it's just such an alien thing,

00:17:28.530 --> 00:17:31.450 line:91%
and the sudden cold did
cause a physical reaction.

00:17:31.450 --> 00:17:33.620 line:85%
I couldn't tell you which that was.

00:17:33.620 --> 00:17:35.210 line:91%
I'm now perfectly comfortable
standing in this.

00:17:35.210 --> 00:17:36.043 line:85%
I think I could,

00:17:36.043 --> 00:17:37.220 line:85%
I can stay up to about here.

00:17:37.220 --> 00:17:40.050 line:91%
I think if my chest went
I'd be back in trouble,

00:17:40.050 --> 00:17:42.100 line:91%
so I'm really glad
I didn't go further.

00:17:42.100 --> 00:17:43.370 line:85%
It's gutting.

00:17:43.370 --> 00:17:45.279 line:85%
Like, it's absolutely gutting.

00:17:45.279 --> 00:17:48.103 line:91%
I'm glad you got to see it.
I'm glad the crew got to see it.

00:17:49.120 --> 00:17:49.953 line:85%
Thank you so much.

00:17:49.953 --> 00:17:52.349 line:91%
<c.cyan>Well, as a caver,
I want to say thank you.</c>

00:17:52.349 --> 00:17:54.441 line:91%
(laughs)
<c.cyan>You gave it your best shot,</c>

00:17:54.441 --> 00:17:57.410 line:91%
<c.cyan>but not only that, you told me
when you felt uncomfortable.</c>

00:17:57.410 --> 00:17:59.630 line:91%
<c.cyan>And as a caver, that's just
what I really want to hear</c>

00:17:59.630 --> 00:18:01.963 line:91%
<c.cyan>is "I'm so uncomfortable.
I don't want to do it".</c>

00:18:01.963 --> 00:18:03.970 position:58% line:85%
<c.cyan>And that's what it's really important</c>

00:18:03.970 --> 00:18:06.290 line:91%
<c.cyan>to communicate with
each other as cavers</c>

00:18:06.290 --> 00:18:08.310 line:85%
<c.cyan>how you feel at all times, really.</c>

00:18:08.310 --> 00:18:10.080 line:91%
Don't worry, I'm going
to start taking ice baths

00:18:10.080 --> 00:18:10.969 line:85%
and get my body used to this.

00:18:10.969 --> 00:18:12.627 line:91%
I want to come back
